{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-23。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"酒店\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"全盈支付\", \"渣打帳戶\", \"橘子支付\", \"icash\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "昨天下午那個 online order 的運動鞋終於 delivery 了，我直接用渣打帳戶付了 2350，這筆算其他類型的收入記錄吧？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 2350, \"category\": \"其他\", \"account\": \"渣打帳戶\", \"description\": \"網購運動鞋\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-10-22\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-09-03。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"西裝\", \"園藝\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"星展信用卡\", \"台新信用卡\", \"國金子帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "昨天去藥局買感冒藥花了 250 元，用國金子帳戶付的"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 250, \"category\": \"日常\", \"account\": \"國金子帳戶\", \"description\": \"感冒藥\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-09-02\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
