{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-29。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"代辦費\", \"配件\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"OPEN錢包\", \"複委託帳戶\", \"SnY帳戶\", \"街口支付\", \"渣打帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "昨天下午去7-11補貨，買了衛生紙跟一些零食，用街口支付付了 450，這筆算 miscellaneous income 的測試 case 吧？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 450, \"category\": \"其他\", \"account\": \"街口支付\", \"description\": \"7-11 衛生紙與零食\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-10-28\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-20。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"贊助\", \"化妝品\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"樂天銀行\", \"街口支付\", \"國泰帳戶\", \"全盈支付\", \"富邦信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "唉，最近感冒好嚴重，剛去藥局抓藥，花了好多錢，用了全盈支付掃碼，大概 850 元左右吧，真是累der"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 850, \"category\": \"醫療\", \"account\": \"全盈支付\", \"description\": \"藥局抓藥\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-10-20\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-01-28。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"創作者基金\", \"手續費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"玉山信用卡\", \"OPEN錢包\", \"歐付寶\", \"國泰帳戶\", \"加密貨幣\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "用加密貨幣收到 8000 元薪水，剛剛到的"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 8000, \"category\": \"薪水\", \"account\": \"加密貨幣\", \"description\": \"兼職薪水\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-01-28\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-29。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"隱眼\", \"中醫\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"彰化帳戶\", \"街口支付\", \"Richart\", \"銀行存款\", \"台灣銀行帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎，我上個月領到的那筆績效獎金，好像是轉到 Richart 了？金額大概是兩萬五千元吧？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 25000, \"category\": \"獎金\", \"account\": \"Richart\", \"description\": \"績效獎金\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-09-29\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-10-12。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"管理費\", \"寵物美容\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"渣打帳戶\", \"國泰帳戶\", \"大戶DAWHO\", \"日圓帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "我昨天去全聯買衛生紙和泡麵，好像是花了 235 元付現金？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 235, \"category\": \"日常\", \"account\": \"現金\", \"description\": \"全聯買衛生紙和泡麵\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-10-11\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-02-26。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"稅金\", \"獎學金\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"街口支付\", \"SnY帳戶\", \"永豐信用卡\", \"樂天信用卡\", \"富邦信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎喲，今兒個家裡那個保險費該繳了，不然斷保可不好。我剛用那個街口支付掃了一下，轉了八千塊過去，這下總算安穩了，你幫我記一筆啊。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 8000, \"category\": \"日常\", \"account\": \"街口支付\", \"description\": \"保險費\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-02-26\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-01。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"電影\", \"西裝\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"星展信用卡\", \"複委託帳戶\", \"Apple Pay\", \"橘子支付\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "昨天去參加那個數位行銷的研討會，中午跟同學去吃飯花了 850 元，我是用複委託帳戶轉帳付的，感覺有點貴但食物還行。"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 850, \"category\": \"飲食\", \"account\": \"複委託帳戶\", \"description\": \"研討會午餐\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-07-31\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-2 (Noise)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-08-01。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"修繕\", \"稅金\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"玉山帳戶\", \"兆豐帳戶\", \"美元帳戶\", \"中信帳戶\", \"永豐帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "欸今天下班後去唱KTV放鬆一下，用永豐帳戶扣了 650 元，感覺還算合理吧？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 650, \"category\": \"娛樂\", \"account\": \"永豐帳戶\", \"description\": \"唱KTV\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-08-01\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-3 (Reasoning)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-05-16。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"自行車\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"樂天銀行\", \"悠遊付\", \"兆豐帳戶\", \"橘子支付\", \"外幣帳戶\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "哎喲，今兒個搭高鐵去台北出差，回來時發現橘子支付帳戶裡多了筆錢，說是上個禮拜四進帳的活存利息，有 120 塊，這算啥收入咧？"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 120, \"category\": \"利息\", \"account\": \"橘子支付\", \"description\": \"活存利息\", \"type\": \"income\", \"date\": \"2026-05-07\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
{"difficulty_level": "Level-1 (Simple)", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "今天是 2026-07-25。你是一個記帳助理。你被賦予了以下 tools:\n{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"description\": \"新增一筆記帳記錄\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"amount\": {\"type\": \"number\"}, \"category\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"飲食\", \"日常\", \"交通\", \"娛樂\", \"醫療\", \"教育\", \"還款\", \"薪水\", \"獎金\", \"零用錢\", \"兼職\", \"投資\", \"利息\", \"欠款回收\", \"其他\", \"補習班\", \"翻譯費\"]}, \"account\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"現金\", \"台新信用卡\", \"數位外幣帳戶\", \"中信帳戶\", \"元大信用卡\"]}, \"description\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"type\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"expense\", \"income\"]}, \"date\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"ISO 8601 格式日期，僅日期精度，例如 YYYY-MM-DD\"}}, \"required\": [\"amount\", \"category\", \"account\", \"type\", \"date\"]}}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "剛剛修繕房屋花了 3500 元用中信帳戶"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<tool_call>{\"name\": \"add_record\", \"args\": {\"amount\": 3500, \"category\": \"日常\", \"account\": \"中信帳戶\", \"description\": \"修繕房屋\", \"type\": \"expense\", \"date\": \"2026-07-25\"}}</tool_call>"}]}
